description=Vendor-provided software Dolby AC3, E-AC3 and E-AC3 JOC decoder for DerpFest 17 on Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu). Metamodule r1 layout with vendor SELinux contexts, HIDL OMX VINTF fragment, and vendor OMX properties.
